   "texts": [
    "波点主题派对的房间里摆着圆桌、圆凳和圆形的地毯。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "90184047"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/96/f4/96f474878e463c98e6c37cdb0ba8afd7.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
